====Usage notes====
* Formerly plural (e.g., “these news are” instead of “this news is”). See [[data]] for a similar case of [[massification]].
* While the British pronunciation has traditionally been {{IPAchar|/njuːz/}}, in recent years {{IPAchar|/nuːz/}} has gained a foothold.

